{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "Panel grid",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "text": "The bottom-left panel's buttons map to a grid of keys, in order, and each shows its letter in the corner. Letters never move: whatever is selected, the first button is Q, the fourth A, the seventh Z.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "text": "The build picker on one of your worlds uses the same letters.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rebind any key in Options > Hotkeys, which has a Reset to defaults button. Button letters follow your bindings.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "text": "Build grid",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "text": "A starbase builds economy and support ships; warships come from a Shipyard. With nothing selected, a letter selects every ship of one class you own, anywhere on the map.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything else",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "term": "Left click / drag",
      "text": "Select / box select",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Shift + click / drag",
      "text": "Add to the selection",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Double-click",
      "text": "Select every ship of a class on screen",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Right click",
      "text": "Move, attack, mine, colonize",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Ctrl + right click",
      "text": "Attack-move",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Shift + right click",
      "text": "Queue an order after the current one",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Right click with a starbase selected",
      "text": "Set a rally point for new ships",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Arrow keys, screen edge, middle-drag",
      "text": "Pan the camera",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Mouse wheel",
      "text": "Zoom",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "T",
      "text": "Stop",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Tab",
      "text": "Select all warships",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "` (backtick)",
      "text": "Select all warships and support ships",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "B",
      "text": "Go to your starbase, then cycle through the others",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Space",
      "text": "Next world of yours",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "F",
      "text": "Build on the focused world",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "R",
      "text": "Research",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "P, or the Pause button",
      "text": "Pause and resume",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "-  /  =  or Numpad -  /  +  (Backspace resets)",
      "text": "Game speed",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Delete  /  Shift + Delete",
      "text": "Self-destruct one selected unit / all selected (starbases ask first)",
      "type": "term"
    },
    {
      "term": "Esc",
      "text": "Clear the selection; with nothing selected, the menu",
      "type": "term"
    }
  ],
  "id": "controls",
  "title": "Controls"
}